service, seem to forget that they have any Master in heaven to serve, or any future reckoning to expect; and many render themselves much more criminal than this wicked and slothful servant who hid his talents in the earth.\"</p>\n<p>Lord. 7:21; Lu 6:46 I knew. 20:12; Job 21:14,15; Isa 58:3; Jer 2:31; 44:16-18; Eze 18:25-29 Mal 1:12,13; 3:14,15; Lu 15:29; 19:20-22; Ro 8:7; 9:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-25-25","title":"Matthew 25:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":25,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":25,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>2Sa 6:9,10; Pr 26:13; Isa 57:11; Ro 8:15; 2Ti 1:6,7; Re 21:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-25-26","title":"Matthew 25:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":25,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":25,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>Thou. 18:32; Job 15:5,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-25-27","title":"Matthew 25:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":25,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":25,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>oughtest. Lu 19:22,23; Ro 3:19; Jude 1:15 with. De 23:19,20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-25-28","title":"Matthew 25:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":25,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":25,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>Lu 10:42; 19:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-25-29","title":"Matthew 25:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":25,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":25,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>unto. 13:12; Mr 4:25; Lu 8:18; 16:9-12; 19:25,26; Joh 15:2 shall be taken. 21:41; La 2:6; Ho 2:9; Lu 10:42; 12:19-21; 16:1-3,20-25; Joh 11:48 Re 2:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-25-30","title":"Matthew 25:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":25,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":25,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>cast. 3:10; 5:13; Jer 15:1,2; Eze 15:2-5; Lu 14:34,35; Joh 15:6; Tit 3:14 Heb 6:7,8; Re 3:15,16 outer. 8:12; 13:42,50; 22:13; 24:51; Lu 13:28; 2Pe 2:17; Jude 1:13; Re 21: